1
00:01:25,840 --> 00:01:30,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Silent Storm]</font>

2
00:01:42,230 --> 00:01:43,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Dongle Manor]
Didn't we agree</font>

3
00:01:43,950 --> 00:01:46,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">not to meet unless necessary?</font>

4
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:49,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've heard some rumors lately.</font>

5
00:01:50,230 --> 00:01:50,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What should I do?</font>

6
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:52,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shut the factory down for now.</font>

7
00:01:53,280 --> 00:01:54,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lie low until this blows over.</font>

8
00:01:55,150 --> 00:01:56,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take it slow and steady.</font>

9
00:01:57,560 --> 00:01:58,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What about the goods in the warehouse?</font>

10
00:02:02,120 --> 00:02:02,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Burn them.</font>

11
00:02:09,440 --> 00:02:12,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 5]</font>

12
00:02:22,680 --> 00:02:23,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look ahead.</font>

13
00:02:24,710 --> 00:02:25,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just read you</font>

14
00:02:25,870 --> 00:02:26,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Suspect's Notice</font>

15
00:02:26,470 --> 00:02:28,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of Rights and Obligations.</font>

16
00:02:28,360 --> 00:02:29,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you understand?</font>

17
00:02:30,630 --> 00:02:32,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't I do a good deed?</font>

18
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:34,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why am I a suspect?</font>

19
00:02:34,910 --> 00:02:36,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Before the court's verdict,</font>

20
00:02:36,360 --> 00:02:37,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">everyone is a suspect.</font>

21
00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:38,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know anything.</font>

22
00:02:38,520 --> 00:02:40,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They coerced me.</font>

23
00:02:40,400 --> 00:02:42,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who? Who coerced you?</font>

24
00:02:42,630 --> 00:02:43,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Liu Bingren.</font>

25
00:02:43,630 --> 00:02:45,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The director
of Haichao Printing Factory.</font>

26
00:02:46,120 --> 00:02:48,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And Li Guangzong, the one who fell</font>

27
00:02:49,150 --> 00:02:49,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">into the sea and drowned.</font>

28
00:02:50,150 --> 00:02:52,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did you get
into Haichao Printing Factory?</font>

29
00:02:54,240 --> 00:02:55,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your skills</font>

30
00:02:55,400 --> 00:02:57,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can really help me a little.</font>

31
00:02:59,590 --> 00:03:00,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is Ahong,</font>

32
00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:00,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">our boss.</font>

33
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:02,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you help me solve the paper problem,</font>

34
00:03:03,030 --> 00:03:04,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll handle your wife's problem.</font>

35
00:03:06,680 --> 00:03:08,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is Mr. Zhou, introduced by Ahong.</font>

36
00:03:08,710 --> 00:03:09,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A technical talent.</font>

37
00:03:11,030 --> 00:03:12,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Guangzong helped me get in.</font>

38
00:03:12,870 --> 00:03:14,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They have a printing factory.</font>

39
00:03:15,080 --> 00:03:16,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They asked me to help</font>

40
00:03:18,190 --> 00:03:19,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with the pressure-sensitive paper.</font>

41
00:03:19,960 --> 00:03:21,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Paper for printing fake invoices, right?</font>

42
00:03:23,280 --> 00:03:24,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But when I got there,</font>

43
00:03:24,560 --> 00:03:25,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't know</font>

44
00:03:25,840 --> 00:03:27,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they used this paper
to print fake invoices.</font>

45
00:03:28,240 --> 00:03:29,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This paper</font>

46
00:03:29,710 --> 00:03:31,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has many uses.</font>

47
00:03:31,360 --> 00:03:34,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It can be used
for anti-counterfeiting inner labels</font>

48
00:03:34,120 --> 00:03:35,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and confidential booklet pages.</font>

49
00:03:36,120 --> 00:03:36,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All of those are possible.</font>

50
00:03:37,120 --> 00:03:37,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In other words,</font>

51
00:03:37,680 --> 00:03:39,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you're not a formal employee
of the factory.</font>

52
00:03:40,030 --> 00:03:41,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No. One night, it was raining.</font>

53
00:03:47,710 --> 00:03:50,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was hit by a car and passed out.</font>

54
00:03:51,910 --> 00:03:53,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Guangzong</font>

55
00:03:53,430 --> 00:03:55,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and Li Ahong saved me.</font>

56
00:03:55,960 --> 00:03:56,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you okay?</font>

57
00:03:56,430 --> 00:03:58,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, I was just repaying a favor.</font>

58
00:03:59,080 --> 00:04:00,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I went with them</font>

59
00:04:00,800 --> 00:04:01,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to the printing factory on the island.</font>

60
00:04:02,470 --> 00:04:04,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After a few days, I realized they</font>

61
00:04:05,190 --> 00:04:06,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">might be printing fake invoices.</font>

62
00:04:07,400 --> 00:04:08,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Special Invoice]
I didn't want to help anymore.</font>

63
00:04:08,240 --> 00:04:09,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wanted to escape.</font>

64
00:04:09,520 --> 00:04:12,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Liu Bingren and his men
caught me, beat me,</font>

65
00:04:12,710 --> 00:04:14,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and locked me in a dog cage.</font>

66
00:04:14,710 --> 00:04:17,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yan Ping'an, an officer,</font>

67
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:20,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and Ouyang Xu from the Tax Bureau</font>

68
00:04:20,480 --> 00:04:22,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can testify for me.</font>

69
00:04:22,600 --> 00:04:24,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They went to the island
to handle a case.</font>

70
00:04:24,480 --> 00:04:25,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After I saw them,</font>

71
00:04:25,920 --> 00:04:27,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I took the initiative to tell them</font>

72
00:04:27,430 --> 00:04:28,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that this factory</font>

73
00:04:29,560 --> 00:04:30,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was printing fake invoices.</font>

74
00:04:30,920 --> 00:04:31,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The factory is physical evidence.</font>

75
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:33,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can be a witness.</font>

76
00:04:34,070 --> 00:04:35,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've been helping the police</font>

77
00:04:35,750 --> 00:04:36,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">solve this case.</font>

78
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:38,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who made the paper they used</font>

79
00:04:39,310 --> 00:04:40,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to print fake invoices?</font>

80
00:04:48,040 --> 00:04:49,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I didn't know</font>

81
00:04:49,360 --> 00:04:50,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they were printing fake invoices,</font>

82
00:04:51,240 --> 00:04:53,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they said the ink wouldn't stick</font>

83
00:04:53,190 --> 00:04:54,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">on the paper,</font>

84
00:04:54,360 --> 00:04:55,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and it happened that I could make it...</font>

85
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:57,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, who made it?</font>

86
00:04:58,830 --> 00:04:59,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I did.</font>

87
00:05:04,870 --> 00:05:06,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They coerced me.</font>

88
00:05:07,040 --> 00:05:07,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, once you knew</font>

89
00:05:07,800 --> 00:05:09,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they were printing fake invoices,</font>

90
00:05:09,510 --> 00:05:10,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">did you keep helping them?</font>

91
00:05:15,800 --> 00:05:17,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I refused, they would beat me.</font>

92
00:05:19,240 --> 00:05:20,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I earned merit!</font>

93
00:05:21,750 --> 00:05:23,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was the one who helped you!</font>

94
00:05:23,480 --> 00:05:24,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Calm down.</font>

95
00:05:25,040 --> 00:05:26,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Merit and crime</font>

96
00:05:26,750 --> 00:05:27,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are two different things.</font>

97
00:05:27,750 --> 00:05:28,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll investigate all of it.</font>

98
00:05:31,830 --> 00:05:33,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I helped you.</font>

99
00:05:33,750 --> 00:05:35,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did I become a suspect?</font>

100
00:05:37,320 --> 00:05:39,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Chunjiang Tax Bureau]</font>

101
00:05:39,120 --> 00:05:40,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">During the capital verification,</font>

102
00:05:40,390 --> 00:05:42,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you sure cursed me out on the phone.</font>

103
00:05:42,600 --> 00:05:43,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You finally got your chance, right?</font>

104
00:05:44,070 --> 00:05:45,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That was a special situation!</font>

105
00:05:45,560 --> 00:05:48,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was acting.
I was getting into character.</font>

106
00:05:48,360 --> 00:05:49,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I had to be convincing.</font>

107
00:05:49,270 --> 00:05:49,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, I think</font>

108
00:05:49,870 --> 00:05:51,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you were speaking your true feelings.</font>

109
00:05:51,720 --> 00:05:52,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I can give you</font>

110
00:05:52,870 --> 00:05:54,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a few figures.</font>

111
00:05:54,430 --> 00:05:55,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fifty-two hours,</font>

112
00:05:56,070 --> 00:05:57,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">sixteen duty vehicles,</font>

113
00:05:57,310 --> 00:05:58,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">ten speedboats,</font>

114
00:05:58,160 --> 00:05:59,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">eighteen armed police officers,</font>

115
00:05:59,040 --> 00:05:59,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">twelve tax officers,</font>

116
00:05:59,920 --> 00:06:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">seventy-two nautical miles.</font>

117
00:06:01,310 --> 00:06:02,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And finally, we found you, Ouyang Xu.</font>

118
00:06:03,310 --> 00:06:04,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That day, you stood in this spot</font>

119
00:06:04,560 --> 00:06:05,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and asked me for funds,</font>

120
00:06:05,680 --> 00:06:07,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">saying you needed
to investigate a toilet.</font>

121
00:06:07,600 --> 00:06:08,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think you undercounted</font>

122
00:06:08,950 --> 00:06:09,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">these figures.</font>

123
00:06:10,160 --> 00:06:11,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You left me out too.</font>

124
00:06:12,070 --> 00:06:13,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These past few days, my heart</font>

125
00:06:13,630 --> 00:06:15,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has pounded thousands of times for you.</font>

126
00:06:16,720 --> 00:06:17,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master.</font>

127
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:19,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know. I made you worry.</font>

128
00:06:20,070 --> 00:06:21,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You were worried about me.</font>

129
00:06:22,310 --> 00:06:23,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master, don't be angry.</font>

130
00:06:23,750 --> 00:06:24,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mind your image.</font>

131
00:06:24,600 --> 00:06:25,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is the office.</font>

132
00:06:26,870 --> 00:06:27,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you got that?</font>

133
00:06:28,190 --> 00:06:29,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Got it, got it.</font>

134
00:06:31,390 --> 00:06:32,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You take these numbers</font>

135
00:06:32,430 --> 00:06:33,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and remember them well.</font>

136
00:06:35,310 --> 00:06:36,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, stop teasing me.</font>

137
00:06:36,870 --> 00:06:38,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master, I need to tell you something.</font>

138
00:06:39,830 --> 00:06:40,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sit down.</font>

139
00:06:41,750 --> 00:06:42,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sit down.</font>

140
00:06:44,190 --> 00:06:44,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master.</font>

141
00:06:45,430 --> 00:06:46,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could you talk to the higher-ups</font>

142
00:06:46,560 --> 00:06:48,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">about Zhou Haiyang?</font>

143
00:06:48,510 --> 00:06:50,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone on this island can prove</font>

144
00:06:50,040 --> 00:06:51,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he was coerced.</font>

145
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:52,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And on this island,</font>

146
00:06:52,920 --> 00:06:53,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">most people</font>

147
00:06:53,830 --> 00:06:55,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">were working without knowing the truth.</font>

148
00:06:55,950 --> 00:06:56,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They lost their freedom.</font>

149
00:06:57,920 --> 00:06:59,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master, if not for Zhou Haiyang,</font>

150
00:07:00,040 --> 00:07:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you would never have seen me again.</font>

151
00:07:03,920 --> 00:07:04,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want to ask you to write</font>

152
00:07:05,600 --> 00:07:06,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a statement to the leaders above</font>

153
00:07:07,120 --> 00:07:08,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in the name of our tax bureau,</font>

154
00:07:08,190 --> 00:07:09,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">explaining the situation</font>

155
00:07:09,870 --> 00:07:10,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and helping him out.</font>

156
00:07:12,310 --> 00:07:13,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Also,</font>

157
00:07:13,120 --> 00:07:14,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">although this time</font>

158
00:07:14,190 --> 00:07:15,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we took down the counterfeiting den,</font>

159
00:07:15,950 --> 00:07:17,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the people selling fakes,</font>

160
00:07:17,270 --> 00:07:18,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the source of the electrotype plate,</font>

161
00:07:19,040 --> 00:07:20,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and the mysterious person
Li Guangzong mentioned</font>

162
00:07:21,070 --> 00:07:22,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">need to be investigated right away.</font>

163
00:07:22,070 --> 00:07:23,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, you're the only one
who gets it, huh?</font>

164
00:07:23,630 --> 00:07:25,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone else is just useless?</font>

165
00:07:25,870 --> 00:07:26,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

166
00:07:27,480 --> 00:07:28,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've already started investigating.</font>

167
00:07:30,680 --> 00:07:31,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I can rest easy.</font>

168
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:32,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get out.</font>

169
00:07:32,720 --> 00:07:34,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't be angry.
Your heart can't take it.</font>

170
00:07:35,720 --> 00:07:36,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I'll get out now.</font>

171
00:07:37,120 --> 00:07:37,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get out.</font>

172
00:07:39,560 --> 00:07:40,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You brat, that's mine!</font>

173
00:07:52,950 --> 00:07:54,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My dear friend.</font>

174
00:07:55,360 --> 00:07:56,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The kid has grown up.</font>

175
00:07:57,800 --> 00:07:59,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's much sturdier than back home.</font>

176
00:08:00,950 --> 00:08:02,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You handed him to me.</font>

177
00:08:02,950 --> 00:08:04,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll take good care of him.</font>

178
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:07,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll protect him. Don't worry.</font>

179
00:08:10,040 --> 00:08:10,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Changfen An?</font>

180
00:08:11,120 --> 00:08:12,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is this Yan's Changfen Diner?</font>

181
00:08:13,680 --> 00:08:14,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh, Xiang.</font>

182
00:08:15,430 --> 00:08:16,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tao.</font>

183
00:08:16,240 --> 00:08:17,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Save my usual spot for me.</font>

184
00:08:18,870 --> 00:08:19,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks.</font>

185
00:08:20,390 --> 00:08:20,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bye.</font>

186
00:08:21,190 --> 00:08:21,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bye.</font>

187
00:08:31,160 --> 00:08:34,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[I promise I won't smoke
or play mahjong anymore]</font>

188
00:08:50,480 --> 00:08:51,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ma'am.</font>

189
00:08:53,600 --> 00:08:54,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Tao.
- Who are you?</font>

190
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:55,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hey, Sheng.</font>

191
00:08:56,750 --> 00:08:57,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where's Changfen An?</font>

192
00:08:57,910 --> 00:08:58,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where is Changfen An?</font>

193
00:08:59,200 --> 00:09:00,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These are comrades from the Tax Bureau.</font>

194
00:09:01,080 --> 00:09:02,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is Ouyang Xu.</font>

195
00:09:02,320 --> 00:09:03,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's Ping'an's partner</font>

196
00:09:03,670 --> 00:09:04,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for this mission.</font>

197
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:08,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ping'an...</font>

198
00:09:08,720 --> 00:09:09,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He earned merit.</font>

199
00:09:11,360 --> 00:09:12,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He earned merit!</font>

200
00:09:12,840 --> 00:09:13,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yan Ping'an.</font>

201
00:09:13,550 --> 00:09:15,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- He earned merit.
- He earned merit.</font>

202
00:09:15,030 --> 00:09:16,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You brat.</font>

203
00:09:16,550 --> 00:09:17,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You brat!</font>

204
00:09:18,440 --> 00:09:19,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tao.</font>

205
00:09:19,440 --> 00:09:19,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You brat.</font>

206
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:21,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tao.</font>

207
00:09:21,630 --> 00:09:22,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You brat, you brat.</font>

208
00:09:24,080 --> 00:09:24,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where the hell have you been?</font>

209
00:09:24,960 --> 00:09:25,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You scared me to death.</font>

210
00:09:25,910 --> 00:09:26,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, okay.</font>

211
00:09:29,480 --> 00:09:32,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you just smoke?</font>

212
00:09:32,790 --> 00:09:33,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whose cigarette is that?</font>

213
00:09:33,720 --> 00:09:34,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who dropped it on the floor?</font>

214
00:09:35,360 --> 00:09:35,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, okay.</font>

215
00:09:35,910 --> 00:09:36,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, let's go inside.</font>

216
00:09:37,320 --> 00:09:38,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I survived a great disaster,</font>

217
00:09:38,150 --> 00:09:38,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so good fortune will follow.</font>

218
00:09:38,960 --> 00:09:39,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Cheers!
- Cheers!</font>

219
00:09:40,440 --> 00:09:42,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My mom made this tea herself.</font>

220
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:43,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's good.</font>

221
00:09:43,480 --> 00:09:44,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone says it's good.</font>

222
00:09:48,360 --> 00:09:48,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, come on.</font>

223
00:09:48,840 --> 00:09:49,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- It smells great!
- Slow down.</font>

224
00:09:51,390 --> 00:09:52,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tao.</font>

225
00:09:53,200 --> 00:09:54,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Make some rice later.</font>

226
00:09:54,670 --> 00:09:55,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's a friend inside.</font>

227
00:09:56,240 --> 00:09:58,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For him, rice is a must.</font>

228
00:09:58,790 --> 00:09:59,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Changfen An,</font>

229
00:10:00,550 --> 00:10:02,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">look at you.</font>

230
00:10:02,630 --> 00:10:04,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What happened?</font>

231
00:10:05,630 --> 00:10:06,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

232
00:10:06,720 --> 00:10:08,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've seen worse.</font>

233
00:10:08,510 --> 00:10:09,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm doing fine now.</font>

234
00:10:09,600 --> 00:10:11,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My arms and legs are fine.</font>

235
00:10:13,630 --> 00:10:15,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Which friend of yours is so fussy?</font>

236
00:10:15,440 --> 00:10:16,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He wants rice</font>

237
00:10:16,270 --> 00:10:17,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">instead of Changfen?</font>

238
00:10:17,240 --> 00:10:20,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's Ouyang Xu, a real rice guzzler.</font>

239
00:10:20,150 --> 00:10:22,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He can't live without rice.</font>

240
00:10:22,320 --> 00:10:24,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What can I do?
We went through hell together.</font>

241
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:28,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All this hell talk is bad luck.</font>

242
00:10:28,750 --> 00:10:29,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why say that?</font>

243
00:10:29,910 --> 00:10:30,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, okay.</font>

244
00:10:30,750 --> 00:10:32,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Crack an egg, and it'll be lucky.</font>

245
00:10:33,270 --> 00:10:34,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Listen to me.</font>

246
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:36,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Safety first.</font>

247
00:10:37,120 --> 00:10:38,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't forget the rice.</font>

248
00:10:38,720 --> 00:10:39,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Changfen Queen.</font>

249
00:10:41,630 --> 00:10:42,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Eat, eat, don't wait.</font>

250
00:10:42,360 --> 00:10:43,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Eat, eat, hurry up.</font>

251
00:10:44,840 --> 00:10:45,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just wait.</font>

252
00:10:46,360 --> 00:10:47,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good, right?</font>

253
00:10:47,390 --> 00:10:47,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Delicious.</font>

254
00:10:49,080 --> 00:10:49,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chicken thigh.</font>

255
00:10:49,510 --> 00:10:50,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come, come.</font>

256
00:10:50,600 --> 00:10:51,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Changfen is here.</font>

257
00:10:52,240 --> 00:10:53,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need, no need to stand up.</font>

258
00:10:53,870 --> 00:10:54,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not for you.</font>

259
00:10:54,750 --> 00:10:55,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's for Ouyang.</font>

260
00:10:56,670 --> 00:10:58,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I made "Guaranteed Full"
specially for you.</font>

261
00:10:58,200 --> 00:11:00,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's Changfen wrapped around rice.</font>

262
00:11:00,360 --> 00:11:02,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is definitely
how you treat your son.</font>

263
00:11:02,240 --> 00:11:02,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Son.</font>

264
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:03,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks, Mom.</font>

265
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:05,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good boy.</font>

266
00:11:05,200 --> 00:11:06,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll make more goodies for you all.</font>

267
00:11:06,790 --> 00:11:07,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait a moment.</font>

268
00:11:07,270 --> 00:11:07,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright.</font>

269
00:11:08,270 --> 00:11:11,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your real son is right here, okay?</font>

270
00:11:11,080 --> 00:11:12,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just eat your food.</font>

271
00:11:13,550 --> 00:11:14,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've been thinking about something.</font>

272
00:11:14,870 --> 00:11:16,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know, we just</font>

273
00:11:16,200 --> 00:11:17,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">took down Dahang Printing Factory;</font>

274
00:11:18,120 --> 00:11:20,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">then Haichao Printing Factory popped up.</font>

275
00:11:20,480 --> 00:11:21,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We finally</font>

276
00:11:21,510 --> 00:11:22,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">got Lin Jianye arrested,</font>

277
00:11:22,960 --> 00:11:24,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and Li Guangzong showed up.</font>

278
00:11:24,360 --> 00:11:25,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why do I feel like this never ends?</font>

279
00:11:26,390 --> 00:11:28,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You have to see the essence of things.</font>

280
00:11:29,440 --> 00:11:31,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where there's huge profit,
there's crime.</font>

281
00:11:32,320 --> 00:11:33,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Those fake invoices of yours</font>

282
00:11:33,600 --> 00:11:34,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are made of paper.</font>

283
00:11:35,440 --> 00:11:35,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's the same</font>

284
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:38,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">as us chasing counterfeit money.</font>

285
00:11:38,120 --> 00:11:41,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fake invoices are even easier
to store and transport.</font>

286
00:11:41,200 --> 00:11:42,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Crime costs are low.</font>

287
00:11:43,200 --> 00:11:44,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If only our technology advances</font>

288
00:11:44,550 --> 00:11:45,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and invoices can use</font>

289
00:11:46,000 --> 00:11:48,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">electronic encryption</font>

290
00:11:48,440 --> 00:11:49,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in the future.</font>

291
00:11:49,200 --> 00:11:50,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I actually researched this.</font>

292
00:11:50,360 --> 00:11:52,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If Chinese character signals</font>

293
00:11:52,200 --> 00:11:53,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are converted into digital signals</font>

294
00:11:53,910 --> 00:11:55,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and then translated back
into Chinese character signals,</font>

295
00:11:55,750 --> 00:11:56,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that would work.</font>

296
00:11:56,670 --> 00:11:57,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've actually thought about this.</font>

297
00:11:58,030 --> 00:11:59,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We can give the entrepreneurs</font>

298
00:11:59,270 --> 00:12:00,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a pager</font>

299
00:12:00,790 --> 00:12:02,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and use the pager to send</font>

300
00:12:02,150 --> 00:12:03,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">encrypted verification codes.</font>

301
00:12:03,480 --> 00:12:04,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We can also set up</font>

302
00:12:04,200 --> 00:12:06,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a unified tax invoice
verification hotline.</font>

303
00:12:06,750 --> 00:12:08,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then we can verify the authenticity</font>

304
00:12:08,320 --> 00:12:09,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of every invoice on site.</font>

305
00:12:09,630 --> 00:12:10,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right.</font>

306
00:12:10,320 --> 00:12:12,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As long as we know
which company received</font>

307
00:12:12,360 --> 00:12:12,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and issued the invoices,</font>

308
00:12:13,320 --> 00:12:14,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the fakes can't escape.</font>

309
00:12:14,600 --> 00:12:15,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You mean</font>

310
00:12:15,670 --> 00:12:17,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this pager can also be a terminal?</font>

311
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:18,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right.</font>

312
00:12:21,120 --> 00:12:22,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you talking about?</font>

313
00:12:22,390 --> 00:12:23,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really don't understand a word.</font>

314
00:12:24,320 --> 00:12:25,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's just stay CID officers.</font>

315
00:12:25,750 --> 00:12:26,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me tell you about this trotter.</font>

316
00:12:27,720 --> 00:12:28,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Recently,</font>

317
00:12:28,750 --> 00:12:29,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the police have been</font>

318
00:12:29,480 --> 00:12:31,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">helping us with the investigation.</font>

319
00:12:31,550 --> 00:12:32,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The information network
for fake invoices</font>

320
00:12:32,910 --> 00:12:34,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has started to surface.</font>

321
00:12:34,720 --> 00:12:37,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The pager is indeed the sales terminal
for fake invoices.</font>

322
00:12:37,720 --> 00:12:38,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We found</font>

323
00:12:38,550 --> 00:12:40,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that these fake invoices seized
at the Haichao factory</font>

324
00:12:40,910 --> 00:12:43,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have flowed to many companies
in other regions.</font>

325
00:12:43,960 --> 00:12:44,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There are no middlemen.</font>

326
00:12:44,960 --> 00:12:46,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's all targeted sales.</font>

327
00:12:46,030 --> 00:12:47,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Buyers and sellers</font>

328
00:12:47,030 --> 00:12:49,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">communicate through pagers and phones.</font>

329
00:12:49,200 --> 00:12:50,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The pickup locations are not fixed.</font>

330
00:12:50,750 --> 00:12:51,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But these people</font>

331
00:12:51,630 --> 00:12:52,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">share one common trait:</font>

332
00:12:53,550 --> 00:12:54,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">None of them have ever seen</font>

333
00:12:54,600 --> 00:12:55,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the mastermind behind this.</font>

334
00:12:56,320 --> 00:12:57,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And this person</font>

335
00:12:57,360 --> 00:12:58,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">knows the backgrounds</font>

336
00:12:58,870 --> 00:12:59,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of both buyers and sellers.</font>

337
00:13:03,320 --> 00:13:04,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want to share with everyone</font>

338
00:13:04,480 --> 00:13:05,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a rather interesting profession.</font>

339
00:13:06,080 --> 00:13:06,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's called a traveling peddler.</font>

340
00:13:07,600 --> 00:13:09,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In the past, transportation
in the mountains was poor.</font>

341
00:13:09,390 --> 00:13:11,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If villagers wanted to buy anything,</font>

342
00:13:11,790 --> 00:13:12,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they had to find this peddler.</font>

343
00:13:13,150 --> 00:13:14,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With a carrying pole and a cart,</font>

344
00:13:14,790 --> 00:13:16,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he went door to door every day.</font>

345
00:13:16,320 --> 00:13:17,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He knew what every household lacked.</font>

346
00:13:18,200 --> 00:13:19,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No matter when he went up the mountain,</font>

347
00:13:19,750 --> 00:13:20,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">no matter how much he brought,</font>

348
00:13:20,720 --> 00:13:21,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">by the time he came down,</font>

349
00:13:22,150 --> 00:13:23,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">his carrying baskets</font>

350
00:13:23,510 --> 00:13:24,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">were always empty.</font>

351
00:13:25,240 --> 00:13:27,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">By the same logic, I think this person</font>

352
00:13:27,510 --> 00:13:28,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">knows the target company</font>

353
00:13:28,750 --> 00:13:29,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and what types of invoices it lacks</font>

354
00:13:30,320 --> 00:13:31,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">like the back of his hand.</font>

355
00:13:32,480 --> 00:13:33,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Moreover, they also have</font>

356
00:13:34,080 --> 00:13:35,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">close ties</font>

357
00:13:36,120 --> 00:13:36,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with the forgers below.</font>

358
00:13:37,390 --> 00:13:38,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're connected from top to bottom.</font>

359
00:13:39,200 --> 00:13:40,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone, think about it.</font>

360
00:13:41,030 --> 00:13:42,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Which department
would have such a talent?</font>

361
00:13:44,960 --> 00:13:46,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't think
this person's rank is high.</font>

362
00:13:47,080 --> 00:13:48,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But they must have broad knowledge</font>

363
00:13:48,360 --> 00:13:49,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and a lot of experience.</font>

364
00:13:49,550 --> 00:13:51,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They probably often work
at the grassroots level,</font>

365
00:13:52,240 --> 00:13:53,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">because they're very familiar</font>

366
00:13:54,080 --> 00:13:55,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with our processes</font>

367
00:13:55,320 --> 00:13:56,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and the needs of enterprises.</font>

368
00:13:57,270 --> 00:13:58,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This peddler</font>

369
00:13:58,440 --> 00:13:59,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is very likely hiding</font>

370
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">inside our tax system.</font>

371
00:14:01,790 --> 00:14:02,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just before the meeting,</font>

372
00:14:02,440 --> 00:14:03,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I already reported this situation</font>

373
00:14:03,480 --> 00:14:05,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to the provincial bureau leaders.</font>

374
00:14:05,630 --> 00:14:06,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The leaders instructed</font>

375
00:14:06,440 --> 00:14:08,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that we soon carry out
a self-cleansing operation</font>

376
00:14:08,630 --> 00:14:10,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">within our tax system.</font>

377
00:14:13,080 --> 00:14:13,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Haiyang.</font>

378
00:14:14,200 --> 00:14:15,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your involvement in making fake invoices</font>

379
00:14:15,960 --> 00:14:17,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is already very clear to us internally.</font>

380
00:14:17,630 --> 00:14:19,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Although you won't face
criminal liability,</font>

381
00:14:19,270 --> 00:14:19,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'll have to return home</font>

382
00:14:19,960 --> 00:14:21,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">under residential surveillance
for six months.</font>

383
00:14:21,870 --> 00:14:23,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll notify you
once the paperwork is done.</font>

384
00:14:24,440 --> 00:14:26,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Haiyang, a few months will pass quickly.</font>

385
00:14:26,720 --> 00:14:27,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can come back later.</font>

386
00:14:27,720 --> 00:14:28,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ping'an and I will come pick you up.</font>

387
00:14:30,030 --> 00:14:30,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Changfen An.</font>

388
00:14:30,750 --> 00:14:32,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mom, let me introduce him.</font>

389
00:14:32,320 --> 00:14:33,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's a new friend</font>

390
00:14:33,550 --> 00:14:35,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">named Zhou Haiyang.
Just call him Haiyang.</font>

391
00:14:35,080 --> 00:14:36,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Haiyang.
- This is my mom.</font>

392
00:14:37,080 --> 00:14:38,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Ma'am.
- Just call me Tao.</font>

393
00:14:38,360 --> 00:14:39,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Hello, Ma'am.
- Come, come.</font>

394
00:14:39,150 --> 00:14:39,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sit, sit.</font>

395
00:14:40,000 --> 00:14:42,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why beer? Drink baijiu.</font>

396
00:14:42,750 --> 00:14:44,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, okay.</font>

397
00:14:44,600 --> 00:14:45,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me tell you, Haiyang.</font>

398
00:14:45,870 --> 00:14:47,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've met countless people.</font>

399
00:14:47,510 --> 00:14:48,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One look at you tells me</font>

400
00:14:48,750 --> 00:14:49,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that in the future,</font>

401
00:14:49,910 --> 00:14:51,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'll either be a big boss</font>

402
00:14:51,670 --> 00:14:53,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or a big villain.</font>

403
00:14:54,390 --> 00:14:55,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't be a bad person, okay?</font>

404
00:14:55,550 --> 00:14:56,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't.</font>

405
00:14:56,240 --> 00:14:56,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't, Ma'am.</font>

406
00:14:57,390 --> 00:14:58,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll make you some snacks
to go with the drinks.</font>

407
00:14:58,630 --> 00:14:59,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you, Ma'am.</font>

408
00:14:59,120 --> 00:15:00,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't pour you any baijiu.</font>

409
00:15:01,030 --> 00:15:01,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need.</font>

410
00:15:01,960 --> 00:15:03,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't let her drink too much.</font>

411
00:15:06,150 --> 00:15:07,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you both.</font>

412
00:15:07,550 --> 00:15:08,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xu, I heard</font>

413
00:15:08,670 --> 00:15:10,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you told your leaders about me</font>

414
00:15:10,870 --> 00:15:11,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and vouched for me with your integrity</font>

415
00:15:12,240 --> 00:15:13,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to have your department issue me</font>

416
00:15:13,960 --> 00:15:15,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a statement of explanation,</font>

417
00:15:15,240 --> 00:15:18,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">saying I was forced to participate
in counterfeiting.</font>

418
00:15:18,840 --> 00:15:19,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you for trusting me.</font>

419
00:15:20,360 --> 00:15:23,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ping'an, thank you for pleading
with the leaders for me.</font>

420
00:15:25,120 --> 00:15:25,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't mention it.</font>

421
00:15:27,030 --> 00:15:28,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Haiyang, I'm sorry.</font>

422
00:15:28,870 --> 00:15:29,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I couldn't help you.</font>

423
00:15:30,360 --> 00:15:31,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's already good enough.</font>

424
00:15:31,480 --> 00:15:32,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At first, I thought I'd go to prison.</font>

425
00:15:34,030 --> 00:15:37,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ping'an,
will this residential surveillance</font>

426
00:15:37,080 --> 00:15:37,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">be written</font>

427
00:15:38,000 --> 00:15:39,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">into my file in the future?</font>

428
00:15:39,270 --> 00:15:40,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Usually not.</font>

429
00:15:41,510 --> 00:15:42,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm afraid it might affect</font>

430
00:15:42,440 --> 00:15:44,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my permit application
to go to Hong Kong, China.</font>

431
00:15:45,480 --> 00:15:46,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't overthink it.</font>

432
00:15:46,480 --> 00:15:48,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't go there right now anyway.</font>

433
00:15:49,200 --> 00:15:49,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just wait.</font>

434
00:15:50,200 --> 00:15:51,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After the return in 1997,</font>

435
00:15:51,870 --> 00:15:52,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there might be a chance.</font>

436
00:15:53,080 --> 00:15:54,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Still three years to go.</font>

437
00:15:54,790 --> 00:15:55,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After these three years,</font>

438
00:15:56,630 --> 00:15:58,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm afraid
we won't even recognize each other.</font>

439
00:16:04,120 --> 00:16:04,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ping'an, Xu.</font>

440
00:16:05,270 --> 00:16:06,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Before I leave Chunjiang,</font>

441
00:16:07,720 --> 00:16:09,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can you two</font>

442
00:16:09,670 --> 00:16:10,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">go somewhere with me?</font>

443
00:16:10,670 --> 00:16:11,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Sure.
- Sure.</font>

444
00:16:53,600 --> 00:16:55,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This was my first time seeing the sea
since coming to Chunjiang.</font>

445
00:16:56,790 --> 00:16:57,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd never seen it before.</font>

446
00:16:58,630 --> 00:17:00,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm afraid I won't have another chance.</font>

447
00:17:00,840 --> 00:17:01,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'll be back in six months.</font>

448
00:17:02,750 --> 00:17:03,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've been in Chunjiang for so many years</font>

449
00:17:04,240 --> 00:17:05,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and never really looked at the sea.</font>

450
00:17:06,160 --> 00:17:07,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I actually see the sea often.</font>

451
00:17:07,750 --> 00:17:10,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Today, let's take a good look
at the sea together.</font>

452
00:17:12,200 --> 00:17:14,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The sea, you really are vast!</font>

453
00:17:18,000 --> 00:17:19,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I never dreamed</font>

454
00:17:19,720 --> 00:17:20,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that two state officials</font>

455
00:17:21,200 --> 00:17:22,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">would watch the sea with me.</font>

456
00:17:22,550 --> 00:17:23,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In high school,</font>

457
00:17:23,350 --> 00:17:24,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my grades were actually pretty good.</font>

458
00:17:24,640 --> 00:17:25,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I also wanted to go to college</font>

459
00:17:26,000 --> 00:17:27,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and become a state civil servant.</font>

460
00:17:28,240 --> 00:17:29,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But unfortunately, I didn't get in.</font>

461
00:17:32,110 --> 00:17:32,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ping'an,</font>

462
00:17:32,830 --> 00:17:35,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if you hadn't become a police officer,</font>

463
00:17:35,160 --> 00:17:35,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what would you do?</font>

464
00:17:38,160 --> 00:17:39,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What would I do?</font>

465
00:17:40,070 --> 00:17:41,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd really like to go into business.</font>

466
00:17:41,510 --> 00:17:43,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Free, flexible, and full of challenges.</font>

467
00:17:44,270 --> 00:17:45,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you go into business
and become the boss,</font>

468
00:17:45,720 --> 00:17:46,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">take me with you.</font>

469
00:17:46,720 --> 00:17:48,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure, call me Mr. Yan.</font>

470
00:17:51,000 --> 00:17:51,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Yan.</font>

471
00:17:51,920 --> 00:17:52,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Yan.</font>

472
00:17:53,070 --> 00:17:54,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop grinning. What about you?</font>

473
00:17:54,720 --> 00:17:55,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right, what about you?</font>

474
00:17:55,830 --> 00:17:56,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't change careers.</font>

475
00:17:57,000 --> 00:17:58,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll keep working in tax.</font>

476
00:17:58,400 --> 00:17:59,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's just one reason.</font>

477
00:17:59,680 --> 00:18:00,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In this world,</font>

478
00:18:00,920 --> 00:18:02,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my master is my only family.</font>

479
00:18:03,110 --> 00:18:04,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I trust my master a lot.</font>

480
00:18:04,550 --> 00:18:05,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He always told me</font>

481
00:18:06,640 --> 00:18:07,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that a person should have faith,</font>

482
00:18:08,160 --> 00:18:09,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and that doing things
requires responsibility.</font>

483
00:18:10,030 --> 00:18:12,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He said tax is vital</font>

484
00:18:12,160 --> 00:18:12,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to the nation's development.</font>

485
00:18:13,440 --> 00:18:14,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, this is a job</font>

486
00:18:14,240 --> 00:18:15,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with a great sense of honor.</font>

487
00:18:16,550 --> 00:18:17,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is a sense of honor?</font>

488
00:18:20,110 --> 00:18:21,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I haven't found it yet.
I'll keep looking.</font>

489
00:18:28,830 --> 00:18:32,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now, Li Fanghua,
Liang Yufei, and Wang Weida</font>

490
00:18:32,750 --> 00:18:35,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[1994 Chunjiang Tax Model Worker Awards]
of Yongpeng County Tax Bureau,</font>

491
00:18:35,350 --> 00:18:36,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">please come up to receive the award.</font>

492
00:18:49,920 --> 00:18:50,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang.</font>

493
00:18:50,680 --> 00:18:51,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Congratulations.
- Thank you.</font>

494
00:18:54,400 --> 00:18:55,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang,</font>

495
00:18:55,440 --> 00:18:56,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when I was first transferred here,</font>

496
00:18:56,790 --> 00:18:58,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the previous leader told me</font>

497
00:18:58,400 --> 00:19:00,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you were a famous model worker here.</font>

498
00:19:01,240 --> 00:19:02,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He said, "Wang is solid as iron,"</font>

499
00:19:02,440 --> 00:19:03,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"while the officials come and go."</font>

500
00:19:03,750 --> 00:19:04,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir, I'm glad to tell you</font>

501
00:19:05,110 --> 00:19:06,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that, with honor in my heart,</font>

502
00:19:06,790 --> 00:19:07,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I shall stay humble in deed.</font>

503
00:19:08,160 --> 00:19:09,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good. Congratulations.</font>

504
00:19:11,160 --> 00:19:12,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're about to retire, right?</font>

505
00:19:12,920 --> 00:19:13,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If we count</font>

506
00:19:14,350 --> 00:19:16,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">from my start date</font>

507
00:19:16,640 --> 00:19:17,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">at 10:30 a.m.,</font>

508
00:19:17,880 --> 00:19:20,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there's still one year,
three months, and one day.</font>

509
00:19:22,110 --> 00:19:22,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Congratulations.</font>

510
00:19:27,350 --> 00:19:28,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you Wang Weida?</font>

511
00:19:30,270 --> 00:19:31,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, I am.</font>

512
00:19:31,550 --> 00:19:33,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I've been unknown all my life.</font>

513
00:19:33,640 --> 00:19:35,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you looking for our leader?</font>

514
00:19:35,510 --> 00:19:36,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're exactly who we're looking for.</font>

515
00:19:36,830 --> 00:19:38,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Weida, we now suspect you</font>

516
00:19:38,160 --> 00:19:39,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of printing and selling fake invoices.</font>

517
00:19:40,750 --> 00:19:41,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please come with us.</font>

518
00:19:42,160 --> 00:19:43,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Detention Warrant]</font>

519
00:19:50,550 --> 00:19:52,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've heard some rumors lately.</font>

520
00:19:52,550 --> 00:19:53,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shut the factory down for now.</font>

521
00:19:53,880 --> 00:19:55,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lie low until this blows over.</font>

522
00:19:55,720 --> 00:19:56,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What about the goods in the warehouse?</font>

523
00:19:57,750 --> 00:19:58,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Burn them.</font>

524
00:20:06,590 --> 00:20:07,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please take it back.</font>

525
00:20:08,590 --> 00:20:09,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's useless now.</font>

526
00:20:14,270 --> 00:20:14,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This...</font>

527
00:20:14,750 --> 00:20:18,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My whole life is a joke.</font>

528
00:20:23,440 --> 00:20:24,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take him away.</font>

529
00:20:29,270 --> 00:20:31,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you waiting for? Don't wait.</font>

530
00:20:33,070 --> 00:20:33,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go ahead and sentence me.</font>

531
00:20:34,830 --> 00:20:36,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Weida, the evidence is conclusive.</font>

532
00:20:37,070 --> 00:20:38,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As a national tax officer,</font>

533
00:20:38,920 --> 00:20:40,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you long participated in and directed</font>

534
00:20:40,590 --> 00:20:42,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the sale and manufacture
of fake invoices,</font>

535
00:20:42,510 --> 00:20:43,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">reaping huge profits.</font>

536
00:20:44,350 --> 00:20:46,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even a small fry like Lin Jianye</font>

537
00:20:47,000 --> 00:20:48,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">got the maximum sentence.</font>

538
00:20:48,830 --> 00:20:50,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know what's coming for me.</font>

539
00:20:50,640 --> 00:20:53,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go ahead. I have nothing more to say.</font>

540
00:20:53,030 --> 00:20:54,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your file is quite impressive.</font>

541
00:20:54,880 --> 00:20:57,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You joined the tax service at seventeen</font>

542
00:20:57,720 --> 00:20:58,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and worked for forty years.</font>

543
00:20:59,240 --> 00:21:00,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bribes you voluntarily turned in</font>

544
00:21:00,960 --> 00:21:03,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and business banquets you declined</font>

545
00:21:03,830 --> 00:21:04,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">numbered in the thousands.</font>

546
00:21:05,590 --> 00:21:07,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You were
such an outstanding tax officer,</font>

547
00:21:07,960 --> 00:21:10,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">yet because of a tape recorder,</font>

548
00:21:10,640 --> 00:21:12,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you went from a model of integrity</font>

549
00:21:12,590 --> 00:21:14,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to a negative example.</font>

550
00:21:15,110 --> 00:21:16,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That tape recorder...</font>

551
00:21:17,640 --> 00:21:18,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I meant to pay for it.</font>

552
00:21:19,270 --> 00:21:22,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I did think about paying it back.</font>

553
00:21:24,350 --> 00:21:27,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Many years ago, my daughter</font>

554
00:21:30,160 --> 00:21:31,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">said to me,</font>

555
00:21:32,030 --> 00:21:32,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"Dad,"</font>

556
00:21:34,830 --> 00:21:36,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"this tape recorder is so nice."</font>

557
00:21:38,590 --> 00:21:39,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"I love it."</font>

558
00:21:40,550 --> 00:21:42,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"I want to use it to learn
a foreign language."</font>

559
00:21:44,550 --> 00:21:47,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now, my daughter lives with deep regret.</font>

560
00:21:48,510 --> 00:21:49,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm so sorry.</font>

561
00:21:49,920 --> 00:21:51,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've let my daughter down.</font>

562
00:21:55,350 --> 00:21:57,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Does this uniform</font>

563
00:21:58,070 --> 00:21:59,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have to end</font>

564
00:21:59,440 --> 00:22:02,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a lifetime of worldly interactions?</font>

565
00:22:02,920 --> 00:22:03,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I...</font>

566
00:22:05,160 --> 00:22:07,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My whole life is a joke.</font>

567
00:22:07,830 --> 00:22:09,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just a joke.</font>

568
00:22:10,350 --> 00:22:11,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Among all of you sitting here today,</font>

569
00:22:12,200 --> 00:22:13,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who has</font>

570
00:22:13,440 --> 00:22:14,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">better professional skills than me?</font>

571
00:22:14,960 --> 00:22:16,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who has gone through more ledgers
than me?</font>

572
00:22:17,200 --> 00:22:18,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No one.</font>

573
00:22:18,880 --> 00:22:20,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To make a key professional like me</font>

574
00:22:20,400 --> 00:22:21,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">sit in front of you</font>

575
00:22:22,000 --> 00:22:23,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and be interrogated by you...</font>

576
00:22:23,880 --> 00:22:25,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you think</font>

577
00:22:25,160 --> 00:22:27,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this is a disgrace to our tax system?</font>

578
00:22:27,680 --> 00:22:28,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How ridiculous.</font>

579
00:22:31,270 --> 00:22:31,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you done?</font>

580
00:22:32,830 --> 00:22:33,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

581
00:22:34,400 --> 00:22:35,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've poured out all your grievances,</font>

582
00:22:35,790 --> 00:22:36,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and I've seen through you.</font>

583
00:22:37,880 --> 00:22:38,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Today,</font>

584
00:22:39,310 --> 00:22:40,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll tell you a story too.</font>

585
00:22:42,510 --> 00:22:45,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">April 20, 1957.</font>

586
00:22:46,030 --> 00:22:47,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That day was Grain Rain.</font>

587
00:22:47,750 --> 00:22:49,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This comrade was twenty-one.</font>

588
00:22:49,350 --> 00:22:50,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He joined the tax system</font>

589
00:22:51,000 --> 00:22:52,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and began his days of collecting taxes.</font>

590
00:22:53,160 --> 00:22:54,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once, he and a colleague</font>

591
00:22:54,830 --> 00:22:55,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">went to the mining area
to collect taxes.</font>

592
00:22:57,750 --> 00:22:58,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">On the way back,</font>

593
00:22:59,110 --> 00:22:59,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">his colleague</font>

594
00:23:00,310 --> 00:23:02,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was shot in the back and died.</font>

595
00:23:02,960 --> 00:23:04,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He was lucky to survive.</font>

596
00:23:05,160 --> 00:23:06,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Later, the bureau issued guns</font>

597
00:23:06,830 --> 00:23:07,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to all those collectors.</font>

598
00:23:08,240 --> 00:23:10,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But they still ran into tax resisters.</font>

599
00:23:12,240 --> 00:23:13,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This comrade completed</font>

600
00:23:13,640 --> 00:23:16,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">every tax collection task successfully.</font>

601
00:23:16,750 --> 00:23:18,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When those tax payments
reached the bank,</font>

602
00:23:18,680 --> 00:23:21,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the money often had his blood on it.</font>

603
00:23:21,920 --> 00:23:23,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It came at the cost of his injuries.</font>

604
00:23:23,640 --> 00:23:24,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I asked him back then,</font>

605
00:23:24,920 --> 00:23:26,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"Didn't the bureau issue you guns?"</font>

606
00:23:27,110 --> 00:23:28,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"Why didn't you use one?"</font>

607
00:23:28,920 --> 00:23:29,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He said,</font>

608
00:23:30,510 --> 00:23:32,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"What ultimately
makes people understand"</font>

609
00:23:32,200 --> 00:23:33,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"the importance of taxes"</font>

610
00:23:34,550 --> 00:23:36,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">"is definitely not guns."</font>

611
00:23:38,640 --> 00:23:39,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Later, this comrade</font>

612
00:23:39,750 --> 00:23:41,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">became a famous tough guy</font>

613
00:23:41,240 --> 00:23:42,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in our tax system.</font>

614
00:23:42,750 --> 00:23:43,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once,</font>

615
00:23:43,920 --> 00:23:45,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when he went to collect
the slaughter tax,</font>

616
00:23:45,720 --> 00:23:46,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that butcher put the money</font>

617
00:23:47,350 --> 00:23:48,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">on the tip of his knife</font>

618
00:23:48,310 --> 00:23:49,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and pointed it at his face,
asking if he dared to take it.</font>

619
00:23:50,880 --> 00:23:52,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For just a few yuan,</font>

620
00:23:52,400 --> 00:23:53,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he collected the tax at knifepoint</font>

621
00:23:54,310 --> 00:23:55,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">without backing down half a step.</font>

622
00:23:57,200 --> 00:23:58,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right here,</font>

623
00:23:58,160 --> 00:23:59,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he was slashed by that butcher.</font>

624
00:24:00,960 --> 00:24:03,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is loyalty to the tax cause.</font>

625
00:24:03,750 --> 00:24:04,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is a role model.</font>

626
00:24:06,160 --> 00:24:06,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right, Zhang?</font>

627
00:24:10,110 --> 00:24:11,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You were right just now.</font>

628
00:24:11,830 --> 00:24:13,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just because of a little favor,</font>

629
00:24:13,830 --> 00:24:15,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">fate can indeed be completely different.</font>

630
00:24:16,440 --> 00:24:18,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What made you sit across from us today</font>

631
00:24:18,680 --> 00:24:19,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is not the country,</font>

632
00:24:19,310 --> 00:24:20,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the bureau,</font>

633
00:24:20,440 --> 00:24:21,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or that tape recorder.</font>

634
00:24:22,510 --> 00:24:23,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's the seed of greed</font>

635
00:24:24,310 --> 00:24:25,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in your heart.</font>

636
00:24:26,270 --> 00:24:27,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's your corruption.</font>

637
00:24:28,160 --> 00:24:28,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Corruption.</font>

638
00:24:31,270 --> 00:24:33,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've only caught me.</font>

639
00:24:34,350 --> 00:24:38,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I have ignited the desire</font>

640
00:24:38,480 --> 00:24:41,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of every person who has shaken my hand.</font>

641
00:24:42,240 --> 00:24:43,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you catch them all?</font>

642
00:24:45,400 --> 00:24:46,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you catch every one?</font>

643
00:24:46,790 --> 00:24:47,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm telling you:</font>

644
00:24:47,750 --> 00:24:48,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The road where justice lies</font>

645
00:24:49,550 --> 00:24:51,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can be walked to the end.</font>

646
00:24:51,400 --> 00:24:52,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The one you chose</font>

647
00:24:53,350 --> 00:24:55,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is a dead-end road of no return.</font>

648
00:24:58,880 --> 00:25:02,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My whole life is a joke.</font>

649
00:25:12,550 --> 00:25:13,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Economic and social development</font>

650
00:25:13,830 --> 00:25:14,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">relies on tax work.</font>

651
00:25:15,720 --> 00:25:17,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We must uphold
the rule of law and fairness</font>

652
00:25:18,000 --> 00:25:19,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to achieve steady and lasting progress.</font>

653
00:25:19,830 --> 00:25:22,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The tax system is
the cornerstone of tax work.</font>

654
00:25:23,240 --> 00:25:23,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As everyone knows,</font>

655
00:25:24,110 --> 00:25:25,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this year, the country
carried out tax reform.</font>

656
00:25:26,480 --> 00:25:28,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It is the largest-scale and the broadest</font>

657
00:25:28,480 --> 00:25:30,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">structural tax reform
since the founding of the nation.</font>

658
00:25:31,270 --> 00:25:31,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It is very significant.</font>

659
00:25:32,510 --> 00:25:34,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There are two landmark events in it.</font>

660
00:25:34,640 --> 00:25:37,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">First, the whole country
uses VAT invoices.</font>

661
00:25:37,590 --> 00:25:39,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Second, the Tax Bureau will be split</font>

662
00:25:39,640 --> 00:25:41,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">into the state tax bureau
and the local tax bureau.</font>

663
00:25:42,110 --> 00:25:43,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Inspection work</font>

664
00:25:43,110 --> 00:25:45,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will become the last line of defense</font>

665
00:25:45,640 --> 00:25:46,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for managing VAT invoices.</font>

666
00:25:58,030 --> 00:26:00,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xu, I suddenly remembered something.</font>

667
00:26:00,880 --> 00:26:01,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know if it'll be useful.</font>

668
00:26:02,070 --> 00:26:02,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ouyang.</font>

669
00:26:03,310 --> 00:26:05,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The information you provided
was very accurate.</font>

670
00:26:05,480 --> 00:26:07,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look, it really can be wiped off.</font>

671
00:26:08,880 --> 00:26:10,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is currently
the simplest and most feasible</font>

672
00:26:10,830 --> 00:26:12,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">inspection method
for this kind of invoice.</font>

673
00:26:12,640 --> 00:26:14,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll report to the director right away.</font>

674
00:26:14,400 --> 00:26:15,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Great, thank you.</font>

675
00:26:15,590 --> 00:26:16,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

676
00:26:16,510 --> 00:26:18,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ouyang, what are you doing?</font>

677
00:26:18,240 --> 00:26:19,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's your award ceremony.</font>

678
00:26:19,640 --> 00:26:20,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The director is waiting for you.</font>

679
00:26:20,480 --> 00:26:21,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master told you to go back now.</font>

680
00:26:21,310 --> 00:26:21,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Listen to me.</font>

681
00:26:22,070 --> 00:26:23,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhou Haiyang provided a new method
for anti-counterfeiting.</font>

682
00:26:24,160 --> 00:26:25,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe the administrative penalty on him</font>

683
00:26:25,590 --> 00:26:26,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can be revoked.</font>

684
00:26:26,400 --> 00:26:27,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What method?</font>

685
00:26:27,310 --> 00:26:28,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Haichao Printing Factory</font>

686
00:26:28,480 --> 00:26:29,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">printed the invoice numbers</font>

687
00:26:29,590 --> 00:26:31,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">using two different kinds</font>

688
00:26:31,270 --> 00:26:31,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of red ink.</font>

689
00:26:32,160 --> 00:26:34,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One of the inks had a quality problem.</font>

690
00:26:34,830 --> 00:26:36,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't solve it at the time.</font>

691
00:26:36,550 --> 00:26:38,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, it's very simple to tell
if it's real or fake.</font>

692
00:26:38,750 --> 00:26:40,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hold the invoice over a fire to heat it.</font>

693
00:26:40,790 --> 00:26:42,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dip some white paper in alcohol
and wipe it.</font>

694
00:26:42,750 --> 00:26:43,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then, the color will come off.</font>

695
00:26:44,480 --> 00:26:45,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As long as we master this method,</font>

696
00:26:46,070 --> 00:26:47,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this batch of fake invoices
that went to market</font>

697
00:26:48,240 --> 00:26:49,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can be found.</font>

698
00:26:50,110 --> 00:26:51,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go tell Master right away.</font>

699
00:26:51,510 --> 00:26:52,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have him contact the police</font>

700
00:26:52,440 --> 00:26:53,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and friends at the procuratorate</font>

701
00:26:53,680 --> 00:26:54,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and explain the situation to them.</font>

702
00:26:55,480 --> 00:26:56,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhou Haiyang did render
meritorious service.</font>

703
00:26:57,110 --> 00:26:59,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe he won't have to go home
under residential surveillance.</font>

704
00:26:59,550 --> 00:27:00,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's good news.</font>

705
00:27:01,920 --> 00:27:02,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh, no.</font>

706
00:27:04,030 --> 00:27:04,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where are you going?</font>

707
00:27:04,640 --> 00:27:05,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm going to the dock.</font>

708
00:27:08,590 --> 00:27:09,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ouyang Xu and I</font>

709
00:27:09,350 --> 00:27:10,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">both got new pager numbers.</font>

710
00:27:10,880 --> 00:27:11,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From now on, contact us</font>

711
00:27:12,030 --> 00:27:13,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">by paging this new number.</font>

712
00:27:13,640 --> 00:27:15,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh, he insisted on giving you
a pair of shoes.</font>

713
00:27:15,920 --> 00:27:18,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I said giving shoes
when someone leaves is bad luck.</font>

714
00:27:18,270 --> 00:27:19,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He said,
"Never mind all that superstition."</font>

715
00:27:19,920 --> 00:27:21,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He wishes your road ahead</font>

716
00:27:21,160 --> 00:27:21,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will be smooth.</font>

717
00:27:23,270 --> 00:27:24,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And my mom</font>

718
00:27:24,110 --> 00:27:25,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">gave you some fruit for the road.</font>

719
00:27:26,790 --> 00:27:27,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please thank her for me.</font>

720
00:27:27,590 --> 00:27:28,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Most importantly,</font>

721
00:27:28,510 --> 00:27:29,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">as soon as you arrive,</font>

722
00:27:30,110 --> 00:27:31,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">go report to the local police station.</font>

723
00:27:35,000 --> 00:27:36,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Forget it. No need to wait.</font>

724
00:27:36,030 --> 00:27:37,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's trying to cancel
the penalty for you.</font>

725
00:27:38,070 --> 00:27:38,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get on board.</font>

726
00:27:41,640 --> 00:27:42,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take care, all of you.</font>

727
00:27:55,720 --> 00:27:56,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Haiyang!</font>

728
00:27:57,480 --> 00:27:58,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhou Haiyang!</font>

729
00:27:58,310 --> 00:28:00,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Between people♪</font>

730
00:28:01,880 --> 00:28:02,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come back!</font>

731
00:28:05,640 --> 00:28:10,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Cups clinking,
we laughing under the sunset♪</font>

732
00:28:12,400 --> 00:28:15,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let glances replace words♪</font>

733
00:28:15,480 --> 00:28:17,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come visit me when you're free.</font>

734
00:28:19,750 --> 00:28:27,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Walking with me through the battlefield
without hesitation♪</font>

735
00:28:27,390 --> 00:28:30,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With tears, sweat, and unease♪</font>

736
00:28:30,210 --> 00:28:33,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still have you to keep me safe♪</font>

737
00:28:34,770 --> 00:28:37,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how fierce the storm♪</font>

738
00:28:37,310 --> 00:28:41,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You shield me
from dangers and bitterness♪</font>

739
00:28:41,900 --> 00:28:44,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With dreams, life, and strength♪</font>

740
00:28:44,720 --> 00:28:48,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We fight for glory, roaming the world♪</font>

741
00:28:49,230 --> 00:28:56,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪A longing I can't forget,
like the morning light♪</font>

742
00:29:21,000 --> 00:29:21,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just one step too late.</font>

743
00:29:22,440 --> 00:29:23,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't get to see Haiyang off.</font>

744
00:29:23,830 --> 00:29:24,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe the residential surveillance</font>

745
00:29:25,110 --> 00:29:26,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can be revoked.</font>

746
00:29:27,750 --> 00:29:28,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A few more days won't matter.</font>

747
00:29:29,110 --> 00:29:30,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once you get the info</font>

748
00:29:30,640 --> 00:29:31,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to the procuratorate,</font>

749
00:29:31,590 --> 00:29:33,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll hurry Chief Luo to handle it.</font>

750
00:29:33,550 --> 00:29:34,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If this residential surveillance</font>

751
00:29:34,720 --> 00:29:35,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can really be lifted,</font>

752
00:29:35,880 --> 00:29:37,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll notify him right away.</font>

753
00:29:40,350 --> 00:29:41,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That night...</font>

754
00:29:41,830 --> 00:29:43,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The night you got drunk,</font>

755
00:29:44,000 --> 00:29:45,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what exactly happened in your room?</font>

756
00:29:46,350 --> 00:29:47,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I need to write my report.</font>

757
00:29:48,070 --> 00:29:49,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you don't come clean,</font>

758
00:29:49,680 --> 00:29:51,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll just write what I imagine.</font>

759
00:29:52,160 --> 00:29:53,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Write whatever you imagine.</font>

760
00:29:53,720 --> 00:29:54,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's see how you write it.</font>

761
00:29:55,550 --> 00:29:56,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Besides,</font>

762
00:29:56,200 --> 00:29:57,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I haven't even asked you
about your room.</font>

763
00:29:57,880 --> 00:29:59,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need to ask.</font>

764
00:29:59,720 --> 00:30:01,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm very well prepared.</font>

765
00:30:01,440 --> 00:30:02,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have a secret weapon.</font>

766
00:30:02,590 --> 00:30:03,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Understand?</font>

767
00:30:03,640 --> 00:30:05,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Spit it out. Come clean.</font>

768
00:30:05,750 --> 00:30:06,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry up.</font>

769
00:30:08,270 --> 00:30:09,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">CID officers are pretty strong.</font>

770
00:30:09,480 --> 00:30:10,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cut the crap. Talk fast.</font>

771
00:30:10,960 --> 00:30:12,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me tell you slowly.</font>

772
00:30:12,030 --> 00:30:12,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Talk.</font>

773
00:30:12,960 --> 00:30:13,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hey, where are you from?</font>

774
00:30:14,200 --> 00:30:15,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jichun in Northeast China.</font>

775
00:30:15,590 --> 00:30:16,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're practically fellow townsfolk!</font>

776
00:30:17,070 --> 00:30:18,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm from Guangzipian.</font>

777
00:30:18,480 --> 00:30:19,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm from a soy sauce factory.</font>

778
00:30:19,880 --> 00:30:22,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you know the Zhou family
in Guangzipian?</font>

779
00:30:22,680 --> 00:30:23,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're super close.</font>

780
00:30:24,440 --> 00:30:25,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know Bingkun?</font>

781
00:30:26,000 --> 00:30:26,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course.</font>

782
00:30:27,240 --> 00:30:28,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's doing great.</font>

783
00:30:28,680 --> 00:30:30,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's bought a huge house.</font>

784
00:30:33,200 --> 00:30:33,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cold?</font>

785
00:30:34,310 --> 00:30:34,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks, bro.</font>

786
00:30:35,510 --> 00:30:36,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cover up a bit.</font>

787
00:30:36,350 --> 00:30:36,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks, bro.</font>

788
00:30:37,640 --> 00:30:38,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bro, here.</font>

789
00:30:39,510 --> 00:30:40,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Try this.</font>

790
00:30:40,640 --> 00:30:42,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sunflower seeds from back home.</font>

791
00:30:42,200 --> 00:30:43,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your family sent them?</font>

792
00:30:43,440 --> 00:30:45,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah. Try them. They're so good.</font>

793
00:30:45,830 --> 00:30:46,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These seeds are great.</font>

794
00:30:47,640 --> 00:30:48,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you need anything, tell me.</font>

795
00:30:48,750 --> 00:30:49,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're from the same hometown,</font>

796
00:30:50,110 --> 00:30:51,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so we should help each other out.</font>

797
00:30:51,720 --> 00:30:53,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't tell them that I am</font>

798
00:30:54,240 --> 00:30:55,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">from Northeast China.</font>

799
00:30:55,550 --> 00:30:56,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I promise I won't.</font>

800
00:30:56,550 --> 00:30:57,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone has secrets, right?</font>

801
00:30:58,030 --> 00:30:59,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bro, remember Ms. Liu?</font>

802
00:30:59,830 --> 00:31:00,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Which Ms. Liu?</font>

803
00:31:01,790 --> 00:31:03,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- She grew pears.
- Ms. Liu with the pear tree?</font>

804
00:31:03,030 --> 00:31:05,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, her pears were amazing.</font>

805
00:31:05,310 --> 00:31:05,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you ever steal any?</font>

806
00:31:05,920 --> 00:31:06,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I climbed up to steal them.</font>

807
00:31:07,350 --> 00:31:08,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I stole them all the time
and got beaten for it.</font>

808
00:31:09,030 --> 00:31:10,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You just cracked sunflower seeds</font>

809
00:31:10,350 --> 00:31:11,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and talked all night?</font>

810
00:31:12,110 --> 00:31:13,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure, it burned through a lot of seeds,</font>

811
00:31:13,830 --> 00:31:14,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but the talk was really deep.</font>

812
00:31:15,440 --> 00:31:17,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You played the emotional card.</font>

813
00:31:17,200 --> 00:31:18,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So heartfelt.</font>

814
00:31:18,030 --> 00:31:20,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What? That's more exhausting.</font>

815
00:31:21,070 --> 00:31:22,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then, the girl just kept crying.</font>

816
00:31:23,310 --> 00:31:25,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once homesickness kicked in,</font>

817
00:31:26,880 --> 00:31:28,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my heart ached too.</font>

818
00:31:28,480 --> 00:31:29,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then, when she was leaving,</font>

819
00:31:29,880 --> 00:31:30,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she insisted on making me
her big brother.</font>

820
00:31:31,270 --> 00:31:33,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She asked me to leave her
my pager number</font>

821
00:31:33,350 --> 00:31:34,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and said she'd change careers and quit.</font>

822
00:31:35,200 --> 00:31:35,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you give it?</font>

823
00:31:36,310 --> 00:31:36,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I did.</font>

824
00:31:38,680 --> 00:31:39,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I gave her yours.</font>

825
00:31:40,920 --> 00:31:42,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why would you give her mine?</font>

826
00:31:43,000 --> 00:31:44,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you crazy?</font>

827
00:31:44,270 --> 00:31:46,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was kidding, silly.</font>

828
00:31:46,640 --> 00:31:47,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm Ouyang Xu.</font>

829
00:31:48,240 --> 00:31:49,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I never change my name or hide who I am.</font>

830
00:31:50,590 --> 00:31:51,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've got to go.</font>

831
00:31:52,240 --> 00:31:53,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The bureau is handing out bonuses today.</font>

832
00:31:53,680 --> 00:31:55,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have to treat my master to a meal.</font>

833
00:31:55,830 --> 00:31:56,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why not join us?</font>

834
00:31:57,790 --> 00:31:58,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Next time, then.</font>

835
00:32:00,400 --> 00:32:00,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hey...</font>

836
00:32:09,830 --> 00:32:10,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang.</font>

837
00:32:12,160 --> 00:32:12,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who's looking for me?</font>

838
00:32:12,960 --> 00:32:13,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief Zhang.</font>

839
00:32:14,960 --> 00:32:15,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That young man.</font>

840
00:32:17,070 --> 00:32:17,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's him.</font>

841
00:32:18,160 --> 00:32:18,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, thanks.</font>

842
00:32:21,160 --> 00:32:21,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Young man.</font>

843
00:32:22,590 --> 00:32:23,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're looking for me?</font>

844
00:32:23,640 --> 00:32:24,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello.</font>

845
00:32:24,510 --> 00:32:26,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're Chief Zhang Haiyuan, right?</font>

846
00:32:26,240 --> 00:32:27,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes. What is it?</font>

847
00:32:57,110 --> 00:32:57,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhang!</font>

848
00:32:58,440 --> 00:32:59,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong, Zhang?</font>

849
00:33:00,880 --> 00:33:01,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Somebody, come quickly!</font>

850
00:33:02,030 --> 00:33:05,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Help! Somebody, help!</font>

851
00:33:19,440 --> 00:33:23,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Two months later, Chunjiang City]</font>

852
00:33:37,350 --> 00:33:37,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir.</font>

853
00:33:38,480 --> 00:33:38,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello.</font>

854
00:33:39,070 --> 00:33:39,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give me a pack of Hongmei.</font>

855
00:33:40,110 --> 00:33:40,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

856
00:33:42,720 --> 00:33:46,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nature's law of survival
is the strong devouring the weak.</font>

857
00:33:47,480 --> 00:33:49,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's also the Creator's choice.</font>

858
00:33:50,750 --> 00:33:53,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Animals cannot change
the order of the food chain,</font>

859
00:33:53,920 --> 00:33:55,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but they can choose</font>

860
00:33:55,400 --> 00:33:58,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a survival mode that suits them better.</font>

861
00:34:05,830 --> 00:34:06,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao.</font>

862
00:34:07,110 --> 00:34:09,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao, I was wrong.</font>

863
00:34:09,840 --> 00:34:11,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao, Tianbao.</font>

864
00:34:11,960 --> 00:34:12,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao.</font>

865
00:34:12,800 --> 00:34:13,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was wrong, Tianbao.</font>

866
00:34:15,840 --> 00:34:16,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao.</font>

867
00:34:16,400 --> 00:34:18,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was wrong. I'm sorry.</font>

868
00:34:18,510 --> 00:34:20,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao, give me one more chance.</font>

869
00:34:20,320 --> 00:34:21,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm begging you, Tianbao.</font>

870
00:34:21,920 --> 00:34:23,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was wrong, Tianbao.</font>

871
00:34:23,960 --> 00:34:25,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao, Tianbao.</font>

872
00:34:25,510 --> 00:34:26,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao.</font>

873
00:34:27,030 --> 00:34:27,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No. No.</font>

874
00:34:30,150 --> 00:34:30,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

875
00:34:30,800 --> 00:34:31,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop, stop.</font>

876
00:34:31,760 --> 00:34:32,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianbao.</font>

877
00:34:32,320 --> 00:34:32,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop, stop.</font>

878
00:34:33,190 --> 00:34:33,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop.</font>

879
00:34:34,000 --> 00:34:34,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop.</font>

880
00:35:30,440 --> 00:35:30,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go.</font>

881
00:35:57,480 --> 00:35:58,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Kill him.</font>

882
00:35:58,360 --> 00:35:59,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Kill him.</font>

883
00:35:59,030 --> 00:35:59,860
